@startuml
title 시퀀스: 플레이어 퍼즐 만료(시간초과) -> 적 패턴 실행

participant Player as "Player(Input/UI)"
participant PuzzleSystem as "PuzzleSystem"
participant BattleStage as "BattleStage"
participant MonsterAI as "MonsterAI"
participant ResultQueue as "ResultQueue"

Player -> PuzzleSystem: 퍼즐 생성/제공
activate PuzzleSystem
note right: 플레이어가 시간내 해결 실패
PuzzleSystem -> BattleStage: OnPuzzleExpired(resultData)
deactivate PuzzleSystem

activate BattleStage
BattleStage -> MonsterAI: Determine monster pattern (owner)
MonsterAI --> BattleStage: patternSkillIdx
BattleStage -> ResultQueue: Enqueue(resultData with monster pattern)
deactivate BattleStage

note over ResultQueue: 이후 ResultQueue가 스킬/공격을 처리

@enduml
